<sp who="#ADE"><speaker><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Adelheid</hi>.</hi></speaker><lb/>
<lg type="poem"><lg n="1"><l>Wohlan er komme.</l></lg></lg></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#KAFR"><speaker><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Kammerfrau</hi></hi></speaker><lb/>
<stage>(o&#x0364;ffnet die Thu&#x0364;r.)</stage><lb/>
<lg type="poem"><lg n="1"><l><hi rendition="#et">Fremdling, tritt herein.</hi></l></lg></lg><lb/>
