<sp who="#ADE"><speaker><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Adelheid</hi>.</hi></speaker><lb/>
<lg type="poem"><lg n="1"><l>Von wannen trugen dich die Lebenswellen?</l></lg></lg></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#GUI"><speaker><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Guido</hi>.</hi></speaker><lb/>
<lg type="poem"><lg n="1"><l>Dem Vater hab ich Schweigen angelobt.</l></lg></lg></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#ADE"><speaker><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Adelheid</hi>.</hi></speaker><lb/>
<lg type="poem"><lg n="1"><l>Du wolltest dich dem Unglu&#x0364;ck zugesellen?</l></lg></lg><lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Guido</hi>.</hi></fw></sp><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0045" n="39"/>
<sp who="#GUI"><speaker><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Guido</hi>.</hi></speaker><lb/>
<lg type="poem"><lg n="1"><l>Im Unglu&#x0364;ck wird die Treue ja erprobt.</l></lg></lg></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#ADE"><speaker><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Adelheid</hi>.</hi></speaker><lb/>
