<sp who="#GUI"><speaker><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Guido</hi>.</hi></speaker><lb/>
<lg><l>Vertrauet mir! ich bin von Gott gesen-<lb/>
det;<lb/>
Mir ist, zu Eurem Schutz die Kraft ver-<lb/>
liehn.</l></lg></sp></div><lb/>
<fw place="bottom" type="catch"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Siebente</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0049" n="43"/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Siebente Scene</hi>.</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<stage><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Berengar tritt auf. Vorige</hi>.</hi></stage><lb/>
<sp who="#BER"><speaker><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Berengar</hi>.</hi></speaker><lb/>
