<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Adelheid</hi>.</hi></fw></sp><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0050" n="44"/>
<sp who="#ADE"><speaker><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Adelheid</hi>.</hi></speaker><lb/>
<lg type="poem"><lg n="1"><l>Ihr nennt den Knaben ha&#x0364;ßlich?</l></lg></lg></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#BER"><speaker><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Berengar</hi>.</hi></speaker><lb/>
